[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:99. Ow]
[00:00.460]Lesson 99. | 第99课
[00:02.915]Oh! | 哦！
[00:05.915]What's the matter, Ted? | 怎么了，特德？
[00:08.565]I slipped and fell downstairs. | 我滑倒了，从楼上摔下来了。
[00:11.835]Have you hurt yourself? | 你摔伤了吗？
[00:13.975]Yes, I have. | 是的，我摔伤了。
[00:15.630]I think that I've hurt my back. | 我想我伤到背了。
[00:18.695]Try and stand up. | 试着站起来。
[00:21.235]Can you stand up? | 你能站起来吗？
[00:23.330]Here, let me help you. | 来，我帮你。
[00:26.505]I'm sorry, Pat. | 对不起，帕特。
[00:28.675]I'm afraid that I can't get up. | 恐怕我站不起来。
[00:31.770]I think that the doctor had better see you. | 我想最好让医生看看你。
[00:35.295]I'll telephone Doctor Carter. | 我给卡特医生打电话。
[00:38.525]The doctor says that he will come at once. | 医生说他马上就来。
[00:42.365]I'm sure that you need an X-ray, Ted. | 我肯定你需要拍X光片，特德。